    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration game played as a robot who has no choice but to travel to different planets, attempting to free them from the enemies that hold them bound. You will find yourself befriending different NPCs and understanding their stories as you find your way through the galaxy. It will take keen navigation skills to go through the different puzzles placed on each planet and make sure the enemies do not win the war. This game is more of a journey than anything, as it holds beautiful visuals and a casual theme to keep the player involved and excited to keep exploring. This game is a 2D platformer that is all about progression as you are able to explore the galaxy and make new friends!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration game played as a robot who has no choice but to travel to different planets, attempting to free them from the enemies that hold them bound. You will find yourself befriending different NPCs and understanding their stories as you find your way through the galaxy. It will take keen navigation skills to go through the different puzzles placed on each planet and make sure the enemies do not win the war. This game is more of a journey than anything, as it holds beautiful visuals and a casual theme to keep the player involved and excited to keep exploring. This game is a 2D platformer that is all about progression as you are able to explore the galaxy and make new friends!</p>",
    "short_description": "It is time, the planets have been invaded and need saved from infinite destruction. The enemies must be stopped from causing any more chaos. Go through challenging space puzzles and seek to be the hero and save the planets within your solar system!",
